---
title: Membership
layout: base.njk
---
<h1>Membership</h1>

<section>
  <h2>Visit</h2>
  <p>It is 100% free to visit as a guest and there will be no pressure to speak
  during the first meeting. Simply come along and enjoy the speeches! We meet
  {{ club.meeting.frequency }}, {{ club.meeting.time }}, in the
  {{ club.meeting.venue }} ({{ club.meeting.address }}).</p>
  <p>Note: on the 4th Wednesday of the month we hold an online committee
  meeting ({{ club.committeeMeeting.time }}) rather than a regular guest
  meeting &mdash; see the schedule below.</p>

  <h3>Meeting schedule</h3>
  <p>Scroll for the full published schedule, including meetings already
  held this year.</p>
  <ul id="upcoming-meetings"
      class="meeting-dates-list meeting-dates-scroll"
      data-meeting-time="{{ club.meeting.time }}"
      data-committee-time="{{ club.committeeMeeting.time }}">
    <li>Loading schedule&hellip;</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Sign up</h2>
  <p>New members pay a one-off fee of <strong>{{ club.newMemberFee }}</strong>,
  then club dues at one of the terms below.</p>
  <table class="pricing-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Price</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for tier in club.pricing %}
      <tr><td>{{ tier.term }}</td><td>{{ tier.price }}</td></tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>{{ club.paymentContact }}</p>
  <p><a class="button" href="/assets/documents/liffey-membership-application-2026.pdf">Download the Membership Application form (PDF)</a></p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Speak!</h2>
  <p>Now it's time to practice speaking! New members are usually assigned minor
  meeting roles to help you gradually build up your confidence. Once you're
  ready, your first speech will be your Ice Breaker &mdash; an opportunity to
  introduce yourself and become more comfortable speaking in front of an audience.</p>
</section>

<script src="/js/meeting-dates.js" defer></script>
